{"comment_text": {"ja44:0.1": "", "ja44:0.2": "", "ja44:0.3": "", "ja44:0.4": "", "ja44:1.1": "When the carpenter asked his son to rid him of a troublesome mosquito on his scalp, he did not think he would do it with an axe. ", "ja44:1.2": "", "ja44:1.3": "For text’s <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vadhissanti</i> read <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vadhissaṁ’ti</i>, reflexive future singular. ", "ja44:1.4": "", "ja44:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja44:0.1": "<article id='ja44'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja44:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja44:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja44:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja44:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja44:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja44:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja44:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja44:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja44:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja44:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja44:0.3": "Atthakāmavagga ", "ja44:0.4": "4. Makasajātaka ", "ja44:1.1": "“Seyyo amitto matiyā upeto, ", "ja44:1.2": "Na tveva mitto mativippahīno; ", "ja44:1.3": "Makasaṁ vadhissanti hi eḷamūgo, ", "ja44:1.4": "Putto pitu abbhidā uttamaṅgan”ti. ", "ja44:2.1": "Makasajātakaṁ catutthaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja44:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 44 ", "ja44:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja44:0.3": "Wanting to Help ", "ja44:0.4": "The Mosquito: a past life story ", "ja44:1.1": "Better is a considerate foe ", "ja44:1.2": "than an inconsiderate friend. ", "ja44:1.3": "Thinking, “I shall kill the mosquito”, ", "ja44:1.4": "the idiot son split open his father’s head. ", "ja44:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja44:0.1": "", "ja44:0.2": "", "ja44:0.3": "", "ja44:0.4": "", "ja44:1.1": "dr27.16, ms22J_96, msdiv44, pts-vp-pli1.247, sya27.15, vri68.11", "ja44:1.2": "", "ja44:1.3": "", "ja44:1.4": "", "ja44:2.1": "ms22J_97"}, "keys_order": ["ja44:0.1", "ja44:0.2", "ja44:0.3", "ja44:0.4", "ja44:1.1", "ja44:1.2", "ja44:1.3", "ja44:1.4", "ja44:2.1"]}